WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.640
The one piece manga finally gave us a glimpse
at the absolutely unbelievable powers of the

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:11.160
mysterious ruler of the world government,
finally ending all speculation whether Imu

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.840
and the Gorosei can fight.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.670
They absolutely can.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:20.750
Plus we learn A TON of absolutely mind-blowing
information about Imu’s true past and confirmation

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.640
of their connections with the mysterious Lili
who was introduced in the last chapter.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:32.590
But what’s even more game changing is that
not one but two individuals saw the secret

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.220
ruler and then barely managed to escape.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:40.129
Which means that very soon we could see the
world government’s darkest secret revealed

00:00:40.129 --> 00:00:42.410
to the entire world.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:47.910
And on top of all that it was confirmed that
Vivi’s family are actually a part of the

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:53.610
legendary D clan, which means that we could
finally learn the secrets about the famous

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:57.719
initial once Vivi reunites with Luffy on Egghead
Island.

00:00:57.719 --> 00:01:02.780
And all of this could lead Vivi on a path
of revenge for her father’s death, but overthrowing

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:08.979
the world government and its rulers looks
like it just became way way more difficult.

00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:13.770
Because this is the very first time we have
ever seen any of the rulers of the world government

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.260
use their powers.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:21.080
And you cannot even imagine how unbelievably
incredible their abilities are.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:25.650
Now, what are these powers?

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:31.430
Well in this chapter we see Imu transform
into a giant shadowy monster with an enormous

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:32.590
mouth and sharp fangs.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:38.550
And he can apparently even eat fire and might
possibly have the ability to create shadow

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.550
arrows.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:45.450
And to push this chapter into even higher
levels of insane hype, the Five Elders even

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:50.520
transform into giant creatures while they
try to prevent Sabo and the king of Alabasta

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.040
from leaving the throne room.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:57.380
So with all of this crazy new information,
let’s run through some possibilities for

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.759
what these powers may actually be.

00:02:00.759 --> 00:02:06.880
The obvious answer for Imu’s abilities is
some sort of super powerful devil fruit that

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.729
lets the user create some kind of dark monstrosities.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:14.040
However, we have actually already seen the
Shadow devil fruit in the story, and this

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.570
is definitely different from those powers.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:21.890
It also cannot be the darkness fruit, since
Blackbeard ate that fruit, so we are left

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.550
with a few options.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:29.550
It could be some sort of legendary devil fruit
that allows Imu to either transform into or

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:32.620
create this enormous shadowy creature.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:38.140
While I’m not totally convinced of this,
one possibility could be a mythical Moon god

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:41.769
fruit as a direct opposition to Luffy’s
Sun god fruit.

00:02:41.769 --> 00:02:47.239
And there’s even Japanese mythology to support
this idea, since in Japanese the moon god

00:02:47.239 --> 00:02:52.290
is called Tsukuyomi and is actually the cast
off husband of the sun god.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:57.250
So already there are some comparisons here,
but let’s take it one step further because

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:02.330
in Japanese mythology, Tsukuyomi is said to
strongly believe in order and will enforce

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:08.360
it whenever he can, even going so far as to
kill in order to maintain order.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:14.760
Hmm, sounds pretty much like the great cleansing
that was mentioned back in chapter 908.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.980
But that is just one possibility.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:22.849
Another could be that the powers are from
some other previously unknown devil fruit

00:03:22.849 --> 00:03:23.849
ability.

00:03:23.849 --> 00:03:30.160
But that’s just the tip of the iceberg here
because what has me super excited about Imu’s

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:35.989
powers is the fact that they could possess
a power that we have never seen before in

00:03:35.989 --> 00:03:37.010
one piece.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:41.500
So taking this back to devil fruits, let’s
establish a few things.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:47.709
First, it has been explained that devil fruit
powers come from the actual devil inside the

00:03:47.709 --> 00:03:48.709
fruit.

00:03:48.709 --> 00:03:54.330
So some sort of mysterious creature or magical
energy source.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:04:00.720
Second, we know these devils are actual things
that exist outside of the particular fruit,

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:06.650
because once a user dies the devil travels
and is reborn inside of another fruit.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:11.879
And all of this makes me wonder if there is
an actual devil or many devils that don’t

00:04:11.879 --> 00:04:14.420
need to exist inside of a fruit.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.650
Like, seriously, why do they need some kind
of host in order for their powers to work.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.609
Do you get what I’m saying here?

00:04:20.609 --> 00:04:22.290
If not, let me lay it out simply.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:28.699
What if Imu’s real power is to control or
summon actual devils that can somehow use

00:04:28.699 --> 00:04:32.070
their own special abilities, just like devil
fruit users.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:38.229
So maybe this creature we are seeing in this
chapter isn’t really imu, but is a devil

00:04:38.229 --> 00:04:40.139
that Imu can summon at will.

00:04:40.139 --> 00:04:47.199
It is certainly a wild idea, but one that
is possible in my opinion and could allow

00:04:47.199 --> 00:04:50.090
Imu to use all kinds of crazy powers.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:55.180
And you may be thinking, hold on Ohara, Dr.
Vegapunk told us that devil fruits represent

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.740
the desire of someone to have a certain power.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:05:02.639
But keep in mind that this is just an in-world
theory and that doesn’t mean that these

00:05:02.639 --> 00:05:05.860
devils can’t be the product of those original
desires.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:11.509
And i mean who knows, Imu and the Gorosei
might even be the original devils or have

00:05:11.509 --> 00:05:15.150
awakened the devil itself inside each of their
fruits.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:20.100
And it would make complete sense to me that
Imu has a power that surpasses all of our

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:25.190
imaginations, similar to how basically no
one expected the actual powers of Luffy’s

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.660
Gear 5 transformation.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:34.520
Maybe this is some way to counter devil fruits
and it has been a secret ability all along.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:44.150
Whatever the true answer, there can no longer
be any doubt that Imu is a true threat and

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.389
not just someone who can only operate behind
the scenes.

00:05:47.389 --> 00:05:55.650
And the same can be said for the Gorosei,
who have these wild beast looking transformations,

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:59.800
which we unfortunately don’t get to see
outside of their silhouettes.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:05.190
However, their shapes do hint that they look
like ancient or mythical creatures, so I wouldn’t

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:11.050
be surprised at all if they each have mythical
zoan devil fruits.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:18.130
But they are clearly monsters in their own
right, which makes me extremely excited for

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:23.280
when we return to Egghead and see Saint Saturn
join the battle.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:28.090
Because this chapter basically confirmed that
the Gorosei are also not some washed up scrubs,

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:34.620
but they can use some insanely overpowered&nbsp;
abilities in a battle.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:39.849
Speaking of the battle on Egghead, we could
be in for a very big surprise when we reach

00:06:39.849 --> 00:06:42.069
the climax of this arc.

00:06:42.069 --> 00:06:49.569
And that’s because if Saint Saturn is actually
an extremely powerful ability user, then we

00:06:49.569 --> 00:06:53.790
could be headed for a surprising turn of events
for the straw hats.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:07:00.139
Because remember that Law and Kid were both
soundly defeated in this very same arc.

00:07:00.139 --> 00:07:05.560
So while we all expect Luffy to come out on
top, it is actually very possible that Luffy

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:08.169
could suffer a similar defeat.

00:07:08.169 --> 00:07:13.560
We’ve discussed this in previous chapter
reviews, but Egghead has a ton of striking

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.129
parallels to the Sabaody arc.

00:07:16.129 --> 00:07:21.919
Most importantly the crew is riding a super
high wave of confidence having just come from

00:07:21.919 --> 00:07:24.349
Wano and defeating an Emperor of the Sea.

00:07:24.349 --> 00:07:30.490
So knowing Oda, this could be the perfect
time to smash all of our expectations and

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:35.889
devil another crushing blow just like when
the straw hats were separated at the end of

00:07:35.889 --> 00:07:40.849
Sabaody.

00:07:40.849 --> 00:07:46.479
Because if there is one thing that Luffy ALWAYS
struggles with, it is a new, surprising power

00:07:46.479 --> 00:07:48.840
that he can’t just punch into the ground.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:54.580
Which sounds exactly like what we could be
getting from Saint Saturn whenever we return

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:55.669
the Egghead.

00:07:55.669 --> 00:08:01.220
Now let’s swing all of this back to Imu
because there are actually a few more mind-blowing

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.620
reveals that were shown in the chapter.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:07.849
So in the last chapter, the Gorosei actually
named Imu in front of king Cobra.

00:08:07.849 --> 00:08:13.750
And then in this chapter, it appears that
Cobra is actually familiar with the name Imu.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:19.080
And Cobra himself basically confirms that
Imu was the name of one of the original twenty

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:24.190
kings, but Imu furiously cuts him off before
he can say anymore.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:29.940
So this seems to confirm a very common theory
that Imu is from the Void century.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:35.630
And while it is possible that this Imu could
just be a descendant of the original Imu,

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:39.220
the information we get next makes that very
unlikely.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:44.560
That’s because Imu then goes on to talk
about Nefertari Vivi as if they actually knew

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.540
the former ruler of Alabasta.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:09:01.450
We don’t stop there because the mind-blowing
reveals just keep coming.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:06.730
Next Imu claims that the D’s were “our”
enemy in the past, which I assume means the

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:07.990
twenty kingdoms.

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:13.320
Even further, he explains that basically all
of the world governments problems today, such

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:19.079
as pirates trying to find the poneglyphs and
scholars researching the void century, can

00:09:19.079 --> 00:09:24.970
be traced to a single event that was all Lili’s
fault back in the Void Century.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:25.970
*Pauses.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:29.589
Breathes out heavily* This is literally incredible.

00:09:29.589 --> 00:09:33.910
Finally some answers and more information
about the void century.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.640
It’s simply amazing.

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:41.959
Now let’s take a moment to wrap our heads
around all of this.

00:09:41.959 --> 00:09:47.779
Based on what Imu says, it seems there was
some plot to completely wipe out the ancient

00:09:47.779 --> 00:09:51.140
kingdom that was almost completely successful.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:58.089
However, Lili spoiled the plan somehow, maybe
by failing in a certain task or leaking some

00:09:58.089 --> 00:10:05.260
secret information.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:07.070
Why would she do this?

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:12.840
Well maybe because she was a D and actually
allied with the ancient kingdom.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.750
Or maybe she was just friends with Joy Boy.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:20.120
But whatever the reason, her actions allowed
for the poneglyphs to spread, which gave hope

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:24.380
to the future generations as we are seeing
in the current story.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:28.990
And Cobra even starts to recite the secret
letter that was left by Lili, which says to

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:32.640
“Protect the poneglyph” and to “raise
the flag of dawn to the world.”

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:38.860
So clearly, Lili for some reason decided to
go against the other twenty kingdoms and leave

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.350
a trail for future generations to follow.

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:50.029
All of this clearly angers Imu in the chapter,
which eventually leads to Cobra sacrificing

00:10:50.029 --> 00:10:53.230
himself so that Sabo can escape.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:11:00.139
What’s even more incredible is that is not
all we see in this epic turn of events.

00:11:00.139 --> 00:11:05.730
Because just as important are the people that
Imu wasn’t able to kill in the throne room.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:10.000
And yes, that’s people, meaning more than
one.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:14.370
Because Sabo was able to escape because of
Cobra’s sacrifice and his insanely strong

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:19.130
devil fruit, this guy [Wapol] was also eavesdropping
on the conversation.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:27.160
When Imu finally notices Wapol, the former
ruler of Drum Island literally munches his

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:31.550
way through the walls of the castle and is
somehow able to escape.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:35.810
Which is actually very curious to me.

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:39.089
Does that mean that Imu let Wapol escape?

00:11:39.089 --> 00:11:43.620
Or maybe Imu didn’t want to make a bigger
scene than this already is?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:49.500
Because clearly they have incredibly dangerous
powers and probably any one of them in that

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.550
room could have chased down Wapol.

00:11:52.550 --> 00:12:00.310
Regardless, both Wapol and Sabo escape with
the knowledge that the world government has

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:04.070
been hiding more secrets than the world ever
dreamed.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:09.709
And at this point, there is absolutely no
doubt in my mind that the world will soon

00:12:09.709 --> 00:12:11.440
be learning about Imu.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:17.540
Although it is odd that the world government
has not been going ballistic trying to keep

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:23.630
this info quite, since it has already been
a month since these events.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.860
So maybe they don’t really care that much?

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:33.470
Anyway, Sabo is currently speaking with the
leaders of the revolutionary Army.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:37.769
And I cannot see any reason why they would
keep this a secret.

00:12:37.769 --> 00:12:43.610
This knowledge is just what they need to bring
more countries to their side as they try to

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.250
overthrow the world nobles.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:51.260
But even if for some reason Dragon decides
to not reveal the secret, then surely Wapol

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:55.810
will spill the beans to this big bird [show
Big News Morgans], who is also head of the

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:59.760
newspapers that are delivered all around the
world.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:04.270
And we’ve already seen that Morgans refuses
to let the World Government censor his news,

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:11.760
so unless he ends up dead then he would have
every reason to share the most mind-blowing

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:14.140
revelation to the entire world.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:19.270
And as we just discussed with the revolutionaries,
this would surely change the world.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:24.041
I mean the whole point of the empty throne
is that the rulers of the world government

00:13:24.041 --> 00:13:25.980
collectively rule the world.

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:34.100
And I don’t think all of these rulers will
want any part of being ruled by a supreme

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.100
overlord.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:40.209
However, none of that may matter, since the
strongest powers in the world are basically

00:13:40.209 --> 00:13:41.589
already in play.

00:13:41.589 --> 00:13:46.101
Those are of course the marines, the revolutionaries,
the good pirates like the straw hats, and

00:13:46.101 --> 00:13:49.170
the not-so-good pirates like Blackbeard.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:54.720
So really, what does it even matter if these
rulers throw a fit because they can’t do

00:13:54.720 --> 00:14:03.529
much anyway, as we just saw when this kingdom
was wiped off the map [Lulusia].

00:14:03.529 --> 00:14:09.480
What is even more insane is that with the
way things are shaping up, it is possible

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:14.230
all of these forces I just mentioned could
actually team up to take down Imu and the

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.930
celestial dragons.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.079
Just think about it.

00:14:17.079 --> 00:14:21.440
More and more, Imu is being set up as the
final villain.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:27.329
And with the Holy Knights of God just introduced
two chapters ago, there is a strong possibility

00:14:27.329 --> 00:14:33.640
that Imu and the Gorosei will be the final
villains of the story with their own super

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:38.040
strong force – including the Seraphim by
the way – and it will take the combined

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:43.070
efforts of Luffy, Blackbeard, and the fleet
admiral Akainu to keep the world from being

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:56.660
cleansed.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:01.670
Personally this twist is super interesting
to me, because it could subvert many of the

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:05.800
expectations that we have had about the final
saga of One Piece.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:09.769
And you know what else this final alliance
could all have in common.

00:15:09.769 --> 00:15:12.670
D. [Make it a big and bold statement on the
screen] As we get closer to the end of the

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:18.019
story, this mysterious initial D that has
been around since the very start of the story

00:15:18.019 --> 00:15:24.980
is starting to seem like the final clue that
will unveil every remaining secret.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:30.279
And once again, we got even more confirmation
that the D’s were the enemies of the twenty

00:15:30.279 --> 00:15:31.279
kings.

00:15:31.279 --> 00:15:35.350
And in this chapter we learned that Vivi’s
family are actually part of the D tribe as

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:36.350
well.

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:40.389
So it’s not just pirates who have this initial
like Luffy, Blackbeard, and even Roger.

00:15:40.389 --> 00:15:43.889
Nor is it just marines or revolutionaries
like Garp and Dragon.

00:15:43.889 --> 00:15:50.290
No, this legendary tribe also included rulers
of kingdoms.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:55.089
So we have to ask the questions that naturally
arise from this reveal.

00:15:55.089 --> 00:15:57.259
Who exactly were the D?

00:15:57.259 --> 00:15:58.259
What does it mean?

00:15:58.259 --> 00:16:09.430
And who else is secretly a part of this family?

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:22.709
Before this chapter, part of me wondered if
all of the original twenty kingdoms were part

00:16:22.709 --> 00:16:26.300
of the D’s, but that is clearly not the
case now.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:31.589
Now it seems that the Nefertari family were
the only D’s of the original twenty kingdoms,

00:16:31.589 --> 00:16:36.029
since they were the only ones to actually
stay behind when the other rulers went to

00:16:36.029 --> 00:16:37.029
Mary Geoise.

00:16:37.029 --> 00:16:42.620
If this is true, then they must have had some
alliance with the ancient kingdom, as we have

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:45.290
already discussed in the last chapter review.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:49.130
Whatever the case, we could be getting the
answers to these secrets very soon because

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:54.100
Cobra’s last words to Sabo were for him
to tell Vivi and Luffy that his family were

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.610
all part of the D’s.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:17:00.550
And we don’t actually know if Sabo was able
to talk to Vivi after escaping, Wapol appears

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:06.699
to have been listening and so he should be
able to pass Cobra’s message onto his daughter.

00:17:06.699 --> 00:17:13.020
And since Vivi is very close to Egghead island
now, she could be meeting up with Luffy on

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.910
the scientific island very soon.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:20.299
But what you may not realize is that this
would also bring Vivi to the one person who

00:17:20.299 --> 00:17:24.860
may actually have answers to the questions
about the D clan.

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:31.500
Of course, that would be Robin who has already
shown interest in the D clan three times in

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.500
the past.

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:36.950
In chapter 180, she asked Luffy about his
family’s initial, but he had no idea what

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:37.950
it meant.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.570
Then in chapter 301, this old sky knight [Gan
Fall] spoke with the straw hats about Luffy

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:45.270
leaving the same impression that Roger did
when he visited the sky island.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:50.370
The third time, and the closest she was to
learning answers, was in Shaky’s Bar on

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:55.250
Sabaody, when the whole crew listened intently
as Rayleigh told them about his journey with

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.270
Roger to Laugh Tale.

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:04.179
And Roger’s former right vice captain basically
implied he knew what the D meant, but Robin

00:18:04.179 --> 00:18:08.789
declined his offer to explain it all to her.

00:18:08.789 --> 00:18:12.880
But all of this was before the time skip and
a lot has happened since then.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:18.391
First she spent two years with the revolutionaries,
and in particular with Dragon, who is one

00:18:18.391 --> 00:18:24.409
of the likeliest people in the world to know
about the D. On top of that, she has read

00:18:24.409 --> 00:18:28.750
many of the most important poneglyphs in the
world during the recent arcs.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:35.179
And while we already knew that, you may not
have ever realized that Robin actually never

00:18:35.179 --> 00:18:38.169
shares what these poneglyphs say.

00:18:38.169 --> 00:18:43.650
We assume they are about the void century
or about directions to Laugh Tale, but surely

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:49.730
at some point she will reveal the actual words
that are on the poneglyphs.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:52.370
This has to happen, right?

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:57.490
A perfect time for this would be when the
straw hats meet up with Vivi and the Alabasta

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.950
princess asks about her newfound family initial.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:05.880
But while it might seem ridiculous that Robin
has never shared this with the crew, it's

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:11.700
not really something Luffy cares about so
he probably never even asked her.

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:17.380
But it is certainly something we care about,
so I can’t wait for the questions to finally

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.049
be answered.

00:19:19.049 --> 00:19:24.200
And even if Robin cannot answer these questions,
there are a few other characters who might

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.200
be able to.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:28.830
Of course there is also Dr. Vegapunk, who
has read the entire library of research from

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:33.059
the island of Ohara, so he is as good a candidate
as anyone to know the truth.

00:19:33.059 --> 00:19:37.679
Or certainly it is even possible that Saint
Saturn could reveal some answers during or

00:19:37.679 --> 00:19:40.140
after the inevitable conflict on Egghead.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:45.780
However, the true nature of the D won’t
be the only question that Vivi is asking because

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.900
she will undoubtedly want to know about her
ancient ancestor Lili, plus all of her connections

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.659
with Imu, Joy Boy, and the Void Century.

00:19:50.659 --> 00:19:54.020
And if you want to know all about how these
three insanely important characters could

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:56.830
be connected, you can watch this video right
here.

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.410
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

